tween routers R 1 and R 2 is highlighted with a dashed red line to indicate a significant link, specifically through interfaces G 0 slash 0 slash 1 on both routers. The subnets connected to Router R 2 are color-coded: 10 dot 2 dot 16 dot 1 slash 22 in yellow and 10 dot 2 dot 32 dot 1 slash 22 in blue. )/T()/K 0/Pg 604 0 R>>
