<</A 8281 0 R/S/Figure/P 6707 0 R/ActualText(The network setup includes a trusted D H C P server connected to router R 1, which is connected to another router R 2 via a network cloud. R 2 connects to a switch labeled "S W 2," which links to P C 1. A spurious D H C P server is also connected to the same switch \(S W 2\), indicating a potential attack. The process shows P C 1 sending a D H C P request, intercepted by the spurious D H C P server, which assigns the I P address 10 dot 1 dot 1 dot 2 with a gateway address of 10 dot 1 dot 1 dot 12 instead of the correct gateway 10 dot 1 dot 1 dot 1 from the trusted D H C P server)/Alt(The network setup includes a trusted D H C P server connected to router R 1, which is connected to another router R 2 via a network cloud. R 2 connects to a switch labeled "S W 2," which links to P C 1. A spurious D H C P server is also connected to the same switch \(S W 2\), indicating a potential attack. The process shows P C 1 sending a D H C P request, intercepted by the spurious D H C P server, which assigns the I P address 10 dot 1 dot 1 dot 2 with a gateway address of 10 dot 1 dot 1 dot 12 instead of the correct gateway 10 dot 1 dot 1 dot 1 from the trusted D H C P server)/T()/K 1/Pg 694 0 R>>
