<</A 7336 0 R/S/Figure/P 6707 0 R/ActualText(The powered devices or P Ds connect to power sourcing equipment or P S E through Ethernet Cables that carry D C power. The P S E connects to an A C power outlet through an A C power cable. A power supply is attached to the P S E.)/Alt(The powered devices or P Ds connect to power sourcing equipment or P S E through Ethernet Cables that carry D C power. The P S E connects to an A C power outlet through an A C power cable. A power supply is attached to the P S E.)/T()/K 0/Pg 865 0 R>>
