<</A 7335 0 R/S/Figure/P 6707 0 R/ActualText(In the center, there is a switch labeled "S W 1" with "Layer 2" written below it, indicating that it operates at Layer 2 of the O S I \(Open Systems Interconnection\) model. Surrounding the switch are four customer routers, each labeled as "Customer Router." On the left side, there are two routers: R 1 and R 2. On the right side, there are two routers: R 3 and R 4. These routers are connected to the switch S W 1, symbolizing how customer networks are interconnected through the Metro Ethernet service.)/Alt(In the center, there is a switch labeled "S W 1" with "Layer 2" written below it, indicating that it operates at Layer 2 of the O S I \(Open Systems Interconnection\) model. Surrounding the switch are four customer routers, each labeled as "Customer Router." On the left side, there are two routers: R 1 and R 2. On the right side, there are two routers: R 3 and R 4. These routers are connected to the switch S W 1, symbolizing how customer networks are interconnected through the Metro Ethernet service.)/T()/K 0/Pg 873 0 R>>
