7035 0 obj
<</A 7127 0 R/S/Figure/P 6707 0 R/ActualText(The screen displays the Chat G P T interface with a white background and green accents, typical of the Chat G P T design. The user's message is: Write me a song about studying for the C C N A certification. Chat G P T 3 dot 5 responds: Sure! Here\220s a song for your C C N A journey: In a world of networks, where data flows, There\220s a path to certify, as everyone knows. It\220s the path to C C N A, the journey\220s begun, Routing and switching, let\220s get this done. Pre-Chorus: Routers and switches, V L A N S and more, Studying protocols, down to the core. Access lists, N A T, and subnet masks, Keep pushing forward, you\220re up to the task. Chorus: It\220s a journey to C C N A, chasing the dream, Configuring networks, it\220s more than it seems. With every command line, you\220re paving the way, To certification, it\220s your C C N A day. Bridge: O S P F, E I G R P, and R I P, Coding static routes, and P P P links. Routing tables, packets, and I P schemes, Making changes in binary, it\220s more than it seems. Outro: Keep going, keep learning, you\220re almost there, C C N A awaits, in the networking sphere. Routers and switches, protocols, and I P, Studying bridges the gap to your C C N A dream.)/Alt(The screen displays the Chat G P T interface with a white background and green accents, typical of the Chat G P T design. The user's message is: Write me a song about studying for the C C N A certification. Chat G P T 3 dot 5 responds: Sure! Here\220s a song for your C C N A journey: In a world of networks, where data flows, There\220s a path to certify, as everyone knows. It\220s the path to C C N A, the journey\220s begun, Routing and switching, let\220s get this done. Pre-Chorus: Routers and switches, V L A N S and more, Studying protocols, down to the core. Access lists, N A T, and subnet masks, Keep pushing forward, you\220re up to the task. Chorus: It\220s a journey to C C N A, chasing the dream, Configuring networks, it\220s more than it seems. With every command line, you\220re paving the way, To certification, it\220s your C C N A day. Bridge: O S P F, E I G R P, and R I P, Coding static routes, and P P P links. Routing tables, packets, and I P schemes, Making changes in binary, it\220s more than it seems. Outro: Keep going, keep learning, you\220re almost there, C C N A awaits, in the networking sphere. Routers and switches, protocols, and I P, Studying bridges the gap to your C C N A dream.)/T()/K 0/Pg 1002 0 R>>
endobj

