<</A 8598 0 R/S/Figure/P 6707 0 R/ActualText(The diagram divides the Cisco\220s fiscal year 2024 into four quarters. Each quarter is represented by a box specifies the months included in that quarter and the corresponding fiscal quarter label. The quarters are represented from left to right as Q1FY24 \(August 2023 - October 2023\), Q2FY24 \(November 2023 - January 2024\), Q3FY24 \(February 2024 - April 2024\), and Q4FY24 \(May 2024 - July 2024\).)/Alt(The diagram divides the Cisco\220s fiscal year 2024 into four quarters. Each quarter is represented by a box specifies the months included in that quarter and the corresponding fiscal quarter label. The quarters are represented from left to right as Q1FY24 \(August 2023 - October 2023\), Q2FY24 \(November 2023 - January 2024\), Q3FY24 \(February 2024 - April 2024\), and Q4FY24 \(May 2024 - July 2024\).)/T()/K 0/Pg 1057 0 R>>
endobj

7067 0 obj
<</A 8594 0 R/S/Figure/P 6707 0 R/ActualText(The horizontal timeline outlines the four main phases of the roadmap over one year. There are four boxes along the timeline representing different phases. The first box is labeled \215Private Review \(Internal\)\216 and spans 3 months from February to April. The second box is labeled \215Public Announcement \(Exam Topics\)\216 covering 4 months from May to July. The third box is labeled \215Exam Release \(Minor Updates\)\216 for 1 month between August and October. The fourth box indicates \215\(No Activity\)\216 spanning 2 months from November to January.)/Alt(The horizontal timeline outlines the four main phases of the roadmap over one year. There are four boxes along the timeline representing different phases. The first box is labeled \215Private Review \(Internal\)\216 and spans 3 months from February to April. The second box is labeled \215Public Announcement \(Exam Topics\)\216 covering 4 months from May to July. The third box is labeled \215Exam Release \(Minor Updates\)\216 for 1 month between August and October. The fourth box indicates \215\(No Activity\)\216 spanning 2 months from November to January.)/T()/K 1/Pg 1057 0 R>>
endobj

7068 0 obj
<</A 8590 0 R/S/Figure/P 6707 0 R/ActualText(The timeline diagram represents the review periods and changes in the C C N A exam from F Y 25 to F Y 29. Each fiscal year is divided into four quarters, Q 3, Q 4, Q 1, and Q 2 of the following year. The diagram shows a pattern where a "Review" takes place every year during Q 3 \(Feb-Apr\). Following the review, there are bars representing the outcome: \215No Change\216 in F Y 25-26 and F Y 27-28, a \215Minor Change\216 in F Y 26-27, and a \215Major Change\216 in F Y 28-29, all occurring in Q 4 \(May-Jul\). An \215Exam Release\216 is shown in Q 1  \(Aug-Oct\) in F Y 26-27, while other years are left blank. An \215Exam Release\216 is shown in Q 2 \(Nov-Jan\) in F Y 28-29, while other years are left blank.)/Alt(The timeline diagram represents the review periods and changes in the C C N A exam from F Y 25 to F Y 29. Each fiscal year is divided into four quarters, Q 3, Q 4, Q 1, and Q 2 of the following year. The diagram shows a pattern where a "Review" takes place every year during Q 3 \(Feb-Apr\). Following the review, there are bars representing the outcome: \215No Change\216 in F Y 25-26 and F Y 27-28, a \215Minor Change\216 in F Y 26-27, and a \215Major Change\216 in F Y 28-29, all occurring in Q 4 \(May-Jul\). An \215Exam Release\216 is shown in Q 1  \(Aug-Oct\) in F Y 26-27, while other years are left blank. An \215Exam Release\216 is shown in Q 2 \(Nov-Jan\) in F Y 28-29, while other years are left blank.)/T()/K 0/Pg 1058 0 R>>
endobj

