<</A 8453 0 R/S/Figure/P 6707 0 R/ActualText(In the first 16 possible subnets of an IPv6 address with a 16-bit subnet field, each address starts with the consistent Global Routing Prefix \2152001:0DB8:1111:\216 and is followed by a varying Subnet field ranging from \2150000:\216 to \2150009:\216 and \215000A:\216 to \215000F:\216 in hexadecimal format. From second to fifth IPv6 addresses are preceded by a check mark.)/Alt(In the first 16 possible subnets of an IPv6 address with a 16-bit subnet field, each address starts with the consistent Global Routing Prefix \2152001:0DB8:1111:\216 and is followed by a varying Subnet field ranging from \2150000:\216 to \2150009:\216 and \215000A:\216 to \215000F:\216 in hexadecimal format. From second to fifth IPv6 addresses are preceded by a check mark.)/T()/K 0/Pg 1073 0 R>>
endobj

